### Application status: expected HTTP 200 and milestone "trip-api"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/status
Accept: application/json

### Operational health: expected HTTP 200 and status "UP"
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Create a trip: HTTP 201 and Location header. Keep dates today or later.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "Jaipur",
  "startDate": "2027-01-10",
  "endDate": "2027-01-14",
  "travelers": 2,
  "budget": 50000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "interests": ["food", "history"]
}

### Read a trip: replace the UUID with the ID from the create response.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trips/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Generate a draft (AI profile + Ollama required); replace UUID with saved trip ID.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trips/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/itinerary
Accept: application/json

### Invalid trip: HTTP 400, errors for destination, travelers, and budget.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "",
  "startDate": "2027-01-10",
  "endDate": "2027-01-14",
  "travelers": 0,
  "budget": -1,
  "currency": "INR",
  "interests": []
}
